label><p>High: being in the highest quintile.</p></fn><fn id="tfn11-ehp-116-1376"><label>g</label><p>Low: being in the lowest quintile.</p></fn><fn id="tfn12-ehp-116-1376"><label>*</label><p>Models where the 95% CIs around the OR do not include 1.0.</p></fn></table-wrap-foot></table-wrap></floats-wrap></article>